{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_13ba5621e65c","title":"得物技术","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNTE3ODU0NA==&mid=2247547863&idx=1&sn=8f307143d06ad3b67031f45c41894ff0&chksm=c008152edb65ed903f1531a8d7f8d890b92796529262bb620c0185c0b607f11e26778d67c85c&scene=126&sessionid=1795853698#rd","description":"技术知识分享交流平台，与你一同走向技术的云端。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"得物技术","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM6shiaicMEVnBkOVxfksCbddUsmSmRaCWFb9k5Tf7kXpaPA%2F0","updated":"2026-11-26T04:00:00.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzkxNTE3ODU0NA%3D%3D:2247547863:1","title":"Akashic知识工程实践｜得物技术","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNTE3ODU0NA==&mid=2247547863&idx=1&sn=8f307143d06ad3b67031f45c41894ff0&chksm=c008152edb65ed903f1531a8d7f8d890b92796529262bb620c0185c0b607f11e26778d67c85c&scene=126&sessionid=1795853698#rd","description":"团队做 AI 研发，知识散在代码、文档和聊天记录里，换个人接活就得重新补背景、核对边界。\n\n想让踩过的坑不再重复踩，Akashic 知识工程把知识存进 Git。\n\nL1 路由、L2 文档/Skill、L3 源码注释，Agent 逐层下读；提交时脚本定位受影响文档，会话归档后双 Agent 提炼回写。\n\n把个人踩坑沉淀为团队上下文。","content":"<p>团队做 AI 研发，知识散在代码、文档和聊天记录里，换个人接活就得重新补背景、核对边界。<br /><br />想让踩过的坑不再重复踩，Akashic 知识工程把知识存进 Git。<br /><br />L1 路由、L2 文档/Skill、L3 源码注释，Agent 逐层下读；提交时脚本定位受影响文档，会话归档后双 Agent 提炼回写。<br /><br />把个人踩坑沉淀为团队上下文。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FFMFU1P6sHHvEQc8CI74DkYOu84HaCAdtXnmFSgH7lSicJTdz8LERvMgiceYSws94NW7puWpAbDlO7Bx1Hc1hovniaf8rIXefPzBHZ2UuImJCiaI%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FFMFU1P6sHHs4hQO6IiaITrWkaZu685CXqrCRSWwnHtTYvGvHcrY7nnFEDq40UIeazyiaBmhFptr03ovNKicYsHBTqvBcFBNIV7tvvNLkoUZ2K0%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.f