"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-26T04:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzkxNTE3ODU0NA%3D%3D:2247547734:1","title":"压测 AI Agent 治理与评测调优实践","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNTE3ODU0NA==&mid=2247547734&idx=1&sn=b209c8551fd912752d56807e042bec74&chksm=c0c0bf07c6cbbffa9ced6195060c3cc3111daa7b5ce1b4dee3d8aa76015211dd0dad0afc4a24&scene=126&sessionid=1795853698#rd","description":"压测平台接了智能分析 Agent 后，我才发现：结论跑偏时，根本不知道坏在哪一环。\n\n于是我们把它治理调优，关键就这几步：\n\n反馈没用→Trace 回放找错因\n改完要验证→冻现场，喂回重跑\n评测三件事→质量、延迟、成本\n最扎心→一次高分不算数，得反复跑\n经验→落成可回放、可对比的用例\n\n坏在哪一环、怎么定位的，评论区聊聊 👇","content":"<p>压测平台接了智能分析 Agent 后，我才发现：结论跑偏时，根本不知道坏在哪一环。<br /><br />于是我们把它治理调优，关键就这几步：<br /><br />反馈没用→Trace 回放找错因<br />改完要验证→冻现场，喂回重跑<br />评测三件事→质量、延迟、成本<br />最扎心→一次高分不算数，得反复跑<br />经验→落成可回放、可对比的用例<br /><br />坏在哪一环、怎么定位的，评论区聊聊 👇</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FFMFU1P6sHHvck3fQqjHFGpsgIagpnjb55rC8RurVllPzCnkFibCJz7VeQuibZ6ZuwTRTrJE8acbqjVcalwUR3dP9uWvVibfsBUQyZnHa2jVBmU%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FFMFU1P6sHHscibia9AbIbTUsW9wofQ4jcYyzLxYpKWBz5P4GRZVmtfAfRk8gomzULQaIqcYELwhj1yxFzmR5SMwmEJnJe85ZlFGSSrSvlUWF4%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FFMFU1P6sHHtxrsfHa0yjMm7UzguYcAQJMJnuhyqQlXvJZ7LleyoxcZTpajSXSAE3LficLicw2ricnmLDbvQZIH2r4US9JXYasu3IiaCZUvuRViaI%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FFMFU1P6sHHtLPW94E2osR1BCktZP3dYulEgcDHQUlv2yTjMDeU7ziarDGwWZPRzzrs662YCzJVg7vJh7vNtnyvaP5GlXuTL0Ubb4z1Pjq6L0%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FFMFU1P6sHHsT3libKkkTunY2tLqPVRGTq6uOSRIhu6BXzW8L03fDJ6KcJ8PDoUVs1iaqXqVeD0mu0SmMGEdOzsc6K2oC9c2